/.lake
LeanEval/*/.lake/
# The standalone LeanEval workspaces are built directly in CI.  Their locked
# dependency manifests are required by `lean-action` before it can configure
# the workspace and restore Mathlib's cache.
!LeanEval/*/lake-manifest.json
*pdf
blueprint/lean_decls
blueprint/print/
blueprint/src/content-bak.tex
blueprint/src/web.paux
blueprint/web/
human_input.md
.claude/
